[Poke:Infinite Ships]
<div>
  <code>POKE #R$F4CF(#N$F4CF),#N$00</code>
</div>

Removes the instruction which would otherwise take a ship away each time one is
lost, so that the number of ships at #R$F5ED never goes down.

<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$F4CF(#N$F4CF)</td>
      <td class="instruction">DEC #REGa</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

To:

<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$F4CF(#N$F4CF)</td>
      <td class="instruction">NOP</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

[Poke:Infinite Fuel]
<div>
  <code>POKE #R$CC50(#N$CC50),#N$00</code>
</div>

Removes the instruction in #R$CC4D which would otherwise add the amount of fuel
used to the fuel level, so that the level that is set at the start of each life
never changes.

<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$CC50(#N$CC50)</td>
      <td class="instruction">ADD #REGhl,#REGde</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

To:

<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$CC50(#N$CC50)</td>
      <td class="instruction">NOP</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
